# ==========================================================================
# PremiumCoffe — .dockerignore raiz (contexto de build del monorepo)
#
# IMPORTANTE — por que .env esta aqui y NO lo bloquea:
#
# Este archivo solo controla que archivos se COPIAN dentro de la imagen.
# No tiene ningun efecto sobre si "docker compose" puede LEER Docker/.env:
# compose lee ese archivo en el host ANTES de construir la imagen, y lo usa
# para sustituir ${VARIABLE} en docker-compose.yml. Son dos mecanismos
# totalmente separados.
#
# Por eso .env debe seguir excluido aqui: si no, tus credenciales de
# Supabase y Cloudinary quedarian selladas en una capa de la imagen, y ahi
# si quedarian de verdad atrapadas para siempre.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Secrets: nunca dentro de una capa de imagen -------------------------
.git/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- VCS / metadatos ------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.github/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.editorconfig

# --- Dependencias y artefactos de build ----------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/out/
**/.mvn/
**/.idea/

# --- Artefactos de Nuxt ---------------------------------------------------
# These three are NOT optional.
#
# .nuxt is the route manifest and the compile cache that Nuxt writes while
# you develop. If it sneaks into the build context, the "COPY Frontend/ ./"
# puts the local .nuxt into the image, and "nuxt build" REUSES it instead of
# regenerating it.
#
# The result is an image with the routes from the last time you ran the
# dev server locally. If you add a new endpoint and you have not started the
# dev server, the endpoint does not exist in the image. And if you did
# start it, the image comes out right, but by accident.
#
# It is the worst kind of build bug: it does not fail, it fails when it
# feels like it. With these three lines, the image depends only on the
# code in the repository.
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/
**/.nitro/
**/.data/

# --- Documentacion y entorno de desarrollo -------------------------------
Docker/ARCHITECTURE.md
Docker/Caddyfile
**/*.md
!Backend/CONTEXT.md

# --- Logs y temporales ---------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.env.local